From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:12:52 +0100
Subject: Adjust the dom and libxml tests to libxml2 2.9.14

libxml2 2.9.12 and newer report some errors differently, no longer
support NUL bytes in HTML documents and limit the XInclude recursion.
Backport of upstream commits f3d1e9ed062 and d818edeae27 (PHP 7.4.21).
